        <h2 data-v-d657fdb1="" class="reveal in mb-2 font-mono leading-none font-bold" style="letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tightest);"> Where I've Been </h2>
        <p data-v-d657fdb1="" class="reveal text-fg-muted in max-w-115 font-mono text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.7]"> Every pin marks somewhere I've stopped along the way — 47 states and counting, mapped automatically as I go. </p>
